  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SCHOOL RENOVATION FOR DISASTER RESILIENCE IN QUANG TRI PROVINCE</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at renovating three degraded schools in the districts of Vinh Linh, Gio Linh, and Quang Tri town, in advance of the coming typhoon season. All three schools are in poor and degraded physical condition and located in typhoon &#x2013; prone coastal areas, which poses significant risks to students&#x2019; and teachers&#x2019; safety.</narrative>
  </description>
